>
> - F
>
> genotypes:
>
>   B: 1
>
>   H: 2
>
>   F: 3
>
>
>  But I noticed that if I change it to:
>
>
> alleles:
>
> - F
>
> - B
>
> genotypes:
>
>   B: 1
>
>   H: 2
>
>   F: 3
>
>
